flowchart TB
  user([User])
  p1[1. Authenticate<br/>register, login, roles]
  p2[2. Ingest and validate data<br/>parse, hourly aggregate, quality score]
  p3[3. Train forecast models<br/>CV, XGBoost per horizon]
  p4[4. Forecast and explain<br/>predict, TreeSHAP]
  p5[5. Detect anomalies]
  p6[6. Optimise cost<br/>tariff, recommendations, scheduler]
  p7[7. Monitor<br/>drift, realised error, metrics]
  d1[(D1 Users and audit)]
  d2[(D2 Datasets and readings)]
  d3[(D3 Models and forecasts)]
  d4[(D4 Anomalies)]
  d5[(D5 Tariffs and recommendations)]
  d6[(D6 Uploaded files and model files)]
  user -->|credentials| p1 --> d1
  user -->|CSV| p2
  p2 --> d2
  p2 --> d6
  d2 --> p3 --> d3
  p3 --> d6
  d3 --> p4
  d2 --> p4
